{"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"apiCredentials","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"forAudience"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"audience"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"scope"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"minTTL"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 60, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"parameters"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Any","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"] = [:], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"headers","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"] = [:], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"callback","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping","kind":"attribute"},{"kind":"text","text":" @"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Auth024CredentialsManagerResulta","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.auth0.Auth0\/documentation\/Auth0\/CredentialsManagerResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CredentialsManagerResult"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Auth014APICredentialsV","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.auth0.Auth0\/documentation\/Auth0\/APICredentials","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"APICredentials"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"audience","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Identifier of the API that your application is requesting access to."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"scope","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Space-separated list of scope values to request when exchanging a refresh token for API credentials. Defaults to "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which will ask for the default scopes configured for the API."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"minTTL","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Minimum time in seconds the access token must remain valid to avoid being renewed. Defaults to "},{"code":"60","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"parameters","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Additional parameters to use when exchanging a refresh token for API credentials."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"headers","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Additional headers to use when exchanging a refresh token for API credentials."}]}]},{"name":"callback","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Callback that receives a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Result","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" containing either the API credentials or an error.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If there are no stored API credentials, the refresh token will be exchaged for a new set of API credentials.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"New or renewed API credentials will be automatically stored in the Keychain. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is thread-safe"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Usage","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Usage"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["credentialsManager.apiCredentials(forAudience: \"http:\/\/example.com\/api\") { result in","    switch result {","    case .success(let apiCredentials):","        print(\"Obtained API credentials: \\(apiCredentials)\")","    case .failure(let error):","        print(\"Failed with: \\(error)\")","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The default scopes configured for the API will be granted if you don’t request any specific scopes. If you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request different scopes than the ones that were granted last time, the API credentials will be renewed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"immediately, regardless of whether they are expired or not.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["credentialsManager.apiCredentials(forAudience: \"http:\/\/example.com\/api\",","                                  scope: \"read:todos update:todos\") { print($0) }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To avoid retrieving access tokens with too little time left, enforce a minimum TTL (in seconds):","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["credentialsManager.apiCredentials(forAudience: \"http:\/\/example.com\/api\",","                                  minTTL: 60) { print($0) }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can specify custom parameters or headers for the exchange request:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["credentialsManager.apiCredentials(forAudience: \"http:\/\/example.com\/api\",","                                  parameters: [\"key\": \"value\"],","                                  headers: [\"key\": \"value\"]) { print($0) }"]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The scope "},{"code":